+# Pilot cohort coverage report
+
+Across the pilot cohort we audited fourteen sites in total. Each visit covered
+billing, metering and settlement as far as the site's instrumentation allowed,
+and the per-site scope is listed below.
+
+- Alder Weir — billing and metering
+- Bramford Rise — billing and settlement
+- Clay Hooton — billing only
+- Dunmarrow — billing, metering and settlement
+- East Ferren — billing and metering
+- Fenn Low — billing only
+- Garrowby Sound — billing and settlement
+- Hexen Mires — billing, metering and settlement
+- Ilkley Toll — billing only
+- Jarrow Fen — billing and metering
+- Kirkby Silt — billing and settlement
+- Lunder Bank — billing only
+- Marrow Quay — billing and metering
+
+Follow-ups are scheduled for the second half of the quarter.
